      "writtenOn": "2022-12-03T05:08:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for pointing that out! I can see the client code here: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:frameworks/av/services/audioflinger/Threads.cpp;l\u003d3363;drc\u003d12488fa6dbc0ccee81e7ec84d3153f379949902e.\n\nI\u0027ve specified in the state machine that after a burst the stream can remain in the ACTIVE state which implies there will be no callback.\n\nUnfortunately, this complicates testing as the state machine becomes undeterministic.",
